 [; ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    §3.10 recurrence — RFC 5545 RRULE + cron (all pure, no clock).
    Expansion vectors cross-validated against a hand-rolled RFC 5545
    reference (Node v22) for last-weekday-of-month (BYSETPOS=-1),
    DST-spanning weekly, and the biweekly MO/WE/FR example.
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ]

